WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:02.400
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.720
Welcome to another episode of Challenge Pongfinity.

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.210
This is the series where YOU challenge US

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:11.320
with your craziest ideas related to table
tennis.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.460
If your comment gets picked

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.639
we will feature it in our next video

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:15.889
and give you a shout out.

00:00:15.889 --> 00:00:19.960
So make sure you leave your comments and ideas
in the comment-section below!

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:28.080
Triple K wants me to stick a bat to my head
and play with it.

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:33.120
Global Threat wants us to make an around the
net shot with a construction hammer.

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:37.040
Let's do this.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:00.800
Orel Mizrahi wants us to make a shot between
two card houses.

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:24.320
Nsubetathenu wants me to do 50 around the
net shots.

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:26.020
FInally I get a proper challenge!

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.280
Otto: There it was hopefully, 50 in a row.

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:36.640
Emil: Empty box also, no more balls left!

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:38.800
Thanks for watching guys!

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.740
If you are new to the channel subscribe here.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:44.080
And watch the previous episodes here!

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:45.980
Until next time!

